  "7525667116604145664": {
   "created": 1794258860,
   "author": "OpenAI for Startups",
   "url": "https://www.linkedin.com/posts/openai-for-startups_this-sunday-were-taking-the-competition-activity-7525667116604145664-XhJh",
   "text": "This Sunday, we\u2019re taking the competition to the poker table.\n\nExcited to sponsor and compete in the No Limit Charity Cup in SF on Nov. 15, with Noam Brown representing us.\n\nHe\u2019ll face founders and top players from Etched, Factory, Applied Compute, DoorDash, fal,\u00a0 Profound, Serval, Sail Research, Conway and more. Proceeds go to Khan Academy.\n\nThanks to Sequoia Capital and Citadel Securities for partnering.\n\nThink you belong at the table? There are a few spots left - see the first comment for info.",
