   "text": "#Etched is hiring a Network Security Engineer\n Location: San Jose, CA\n Salary: $150K\u2013$350K, depending on experience\nAn exciting opportunity to join a high-growth AI infrastructure company and help build and secure next-generation computing infrastructure.\nWhat We're Looking For \u2013 Ideal Candidate Profile:\n5+ years of hands-on network engineering and security experience.\nStrong expertise in Fortinet (FortiGate, FortiSASE) and Arista networking.\nExperience designing and implementing Zero Trust security architectures.\nSolid understanding of firewalls, IDS/IPS, NDR and threat detection.\nProficiency in Linux networking, BGP and network automation.\nExperience with data centers, cloud infrastructure",
