  "7525637748909711360": {
   "created": 1794251858,
   "author": "Alexander Averhoff",
   "url": "https://www.linkedin.com/feed/update/urn:li:groupPost:10472901-7525637747957571584",
   "text": "Physical Design (Place & Route) Engineer - Contract\n\nStill Open\n\nClient: Etched\nLocation: 100% Remote in U.S.\nDuration: 6-12 Months\nRate: 150/hr\nMUST be US CITIZEN Only\n\nPhysical Design (Place & Route) Engineer, ASIC - 100% Remote\n\nAbout the Role\nOur ASIC team is hiring a seasoned Place and Route (P&R) Engineer to own the physical implementation of complex, high-performance chips. You will take designs from a synthesized netlist all the way to final GDSII, pushing hard on power, performance and area (PPA) while protecting design integrity, manufacturability and the schedule.\n\nWhat You\u2019ll Do\n\nRun full-chip physical implementation from netlist to GDSII, covering floorplanning, power planning, ",
