   "text": "\ud83c\udf10 THE GLOBAL TECHNOLOGY & INFRASTRUCTURE ECOSYSTEM | 400+ COMPANIES\n\nPart (1/3)\n\n1. SEMICONDUCTOR DESIGN & FABLESS COMPANIES\n\nUS NVIDIA\nUS AMD\nUS Qualcomm\nUS Broadcom\nUS Marvell Technology\nTW MediaTek\nTW Realtek\nTW Novatek\nUS Cirrus Logic\nUS Lattice Semiconductor\nUS Monolithic Power Systems\nUS Qorvo\nUS Skyworks Solutions\nUS Ambarella\nUS Synaptics\nUS Silicon Laboratories\nUS MaxLinear\nUS Semtech\nUS Rambus\nUS Astera Labs\nUS Credo Technology\nUK Alphawave Semi\nUS SiFive\nCA Tenstorrent\nUS Cerebras Systems\nUS Groq\nUS SambaNova Systems\nUK Graphcore\nIL Hailo\nKR Rebellions\nKR FuriosaAI\nCN Biren Technology\nCN Moore Threads\nCN Cambricon\nCN VeriSilicon\nTW Alchip Technologies\nTW GUC\nJP Socionext\nUS Achron",
