   "text": "Thank you to our partners for joining us at the inaugural Deviation AGM. Celebrating the launch of Deviation alongside the institutions that have supported us was a special moment for the whole team. Colin Beirne Jonathan Golden Dusan Perovic\n\nWe are in AI\u2019s installation period, and the companies built now will lay the foundation for the next few decades of innovation. There has never been a more exciting time to invest in new technologies and work with founders at the very start of their journeys.\n\nAlways an honor to recognize the phenomenal progress across our portfolio Etched Kalshi Bedrock Robotics Terray Therapeutics Remote Osmo Xaira Therapeutics and many more  \ud83d\udc4f \n\nOur team left gratef",
