   "text": "Thank you to the founders and investors who joined Deviation\u2019s inaugural AGM in our home neighborhood of SoHo! It was amazing to bring together such a diverse group of companies, each tackling a different challenge with AI. A few highlights:\n\n- Fireside chat with Marc Tessier-Lavigne (Xaira Therapeutics) on the future of drug discovery\n- Presentations from founders building across robotics (Walden Robotics), neolabs, and techbio\n- Alex Wiltschko's (Osmo) interactive scent salon \n- Celebrating wins across the portfolio from Etched, Remote, Bedrock Robotics, Kalshi and many more",
